; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 35. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'btDE_olman'
btDE_olman.dialogstring_098903! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0]An aged body lies quietly[N]before Will and Kara[AD][FIN]Then a familiar voice[N]speaks inside Will's[N]mind.[FIN][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Will[AD] It's me. Your[N]father, Olman.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]My body has long since[N]decayed, but my mind[N]still remains here.[END]`
btDE_olman.dialogstring_0989A2! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will][DLY:1]Will: D-dad…! Why are you[N]like this!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Olman: The Tower of Babel[N]is steeped in the comet's[N]light.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Time races here. Most[N]living bodies cannot[N]endure its influence[N]for long.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will][DLY:1]Will: Then how can Kara[N]and I survive here?[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Olman: That flute was my[N]gift to you.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Before I left on my[N]expedition, I affixed the[N]dark Crystal Ring to it.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]When you entered this [N]tower as a child, the ring[N]shielded you from the     [N]comet's full light.       [FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]It could not keep that[N]light from touching you…[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]but it kept the comet from[N]deciding what you would[N]become.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Olman: Kara carries its[N]counterpart, preserved[N]aboard the Incan Gold[N]Ship.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]The two rings are relics[N]of the ancient division[N]between Light and[N]Darkness.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]And neither of you belongs[N]wholly to one side of that[N]ancient war.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Will, you descend from[N]the Dark Knights.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]But the comet's light[N]entered you as well.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Olman: Kara, your blood[N]descends from the[N]Protectors of Light.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:1]Kara: But Gaia has spoken[N]to me in my dreams.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:1]So both of us have been[N]touched by the other[N]side…[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Olman: Exactly. Powers[N]your ancestors kept apart[N]now meet within the two of[N]you.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]The six Mystic Statues are[N]remnants of the old rite[N]that joined those powers.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]With the final one, the[N]path to the Warrior of[N]Light and Darkness will[N]be complete.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]Take it, Will.[N]What happens next must be[N]your decision.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will][DLY:1]Will: Our decision.[END]`
btDE_olman.dialogstring_098CAA! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]The comet will be very[N]near soon.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Flute][DLY:2]I must send you both to[N]the tower's rooftop[N]before then.[FIN][DLY:4]Close your eyes now[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE4_olman'
btE4_olman.dialogstring_099068! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]Olman: The comet is[N]conscious, though not evil[N]in the simple way[N]people use that word.[WAI][N]Its promise is real.[WAI][N]Its light can release the[N]mind from sickness, age,[N]death, and even the body.[WAI][N]The Moon Tribe received[N]that light long ago.[WAI][N]They gained ageless life,[N]yet remember the comet[N]as a destroyer.[WAI][N]The Fallen Wings descend[N]from people of Mu who[N]accepted that same light.[WAI][N]Their descendants still[N]call what they inherited[N]a gift.[WAI][N]One remembers a blessing.[N]Another, a curse.[N]Neither memory is false.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]The choice offered is[N]a real one.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]But its answer is final.[N]The comet would draw life[N]into a lasting form.[WAI][N]Gaia offers no world free[N]of grief or death.[WAI][N]Her path leaves life[N]mortal, changing, and[N]unfinished.[WAI][N]I spent years searching[N]ruins for an answer.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]I found history.[N]Not certainty.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]Look around you, Will.[N]Listen to those who lived[N]with either path.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_099182! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]Olman: Go. Speak with them[N]before you decide what the[N]future should mean.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE4_kara'
btE4_kara.dialogstring_098DFD! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: …[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE4_olman'
btE4_olman.dialogstring_0992EC! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Neil's father: Hey[AD][N]What in the world is[N]Neil doing?[WAI][N]That boy had better make[N]something worthwhile of[N]the Reuleck Corporation.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_0994E6! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]I shed my mortal body and[N]no longer age or die.[WAI][N]The comet's light gave me[N]the eternal life I once[N]thought I wanted.[WAI][N]But for me, an endless[N]life without a body became[N]emptier than I imagined.[WAI][N]Strange… I felt more alive[N]when each day mattered[N]because I knew my time was[N]limited.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_09923A! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: Heh. Didn't expect[N]to see me again, did you?[FIN]Don't waste your pity,[N]kid.[FIN]I knew what I was doing.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_09943E! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Rama: I was king of Mu.[N]When the light came, my[N]people did not choose as[N]one.[WAI][N]Some welcomed it; others[N]rejected it.[N]I wore a crown, but had no[N]right to choose for them.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_09938D! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Neil's mother: I can still[N]watch the living world,[N]but I cannot touch it.[WAI][N]No matter how much Neil[N]struggles, I cannot reach[N]out and lend him a hand.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_0991A9! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]Olman: The moment is[N]nearly here.[WAI][N]Everyone[AD] lend your power[N]to Will and Kara.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE4_kara'
btE4_kara.dialogstring_098E17! `[CLD][DEF]When Will and Kara join[N]their wills,[FIN][CLD][DEF]not because[N]their bloodlines command[N]it, but because they[N]choose one another,[FIN][CLD][DEF]light and darkness answer[N]together.[FIN][CLD][DEF]The Firebird awakens: a[N]power neither ancient[N]tradition possessed alone.[FIN][CLD][DEF]The form once called the[N]Warrior of Light and[N]Darkness returns.[END]`
btE4_kara.dialogstring_098EB8! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]Olman: Your choice will[N]shape Earth's future.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Dad… How can we[N]decide what is right for[N]everyone?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I don't think we[N]can. Hamlet chose to die[N]so those starving[N]villagers could live.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]We met Sam and the[N]others who were sold[N]when their families[N]went hungry.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: And there were[N]people we never reached[N]in time.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Seth changed into[N]something neither of us[N]understood. But he was[N]still Seth.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: All we really know[N]is what we've seen with[N]our own eyes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Then maybe we[N]shouldn't choose for[N]everyone.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: No. We choose what[N]we would want if these[N]were our own lives.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]Then go.[N]Face the comet, and choose[N]for yourselves.[END]`
